<div style="background:#f5f5f5;border-bottom:1px solid #d0d0d0;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
<span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111;letter-spacing:0.02em;">COMPOSÉ TSX, QUOTIDIEN</span>
<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">36&nbsp;730,27</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#c0392b;">&#9660; -0,08&nbsp;% VENDREDI</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">QUOTIDIEN &nbsp;|&nbsp; 14 JUILL. AU 14 AOÛ 2026</span>
